t\",\n        \"text\": \"Do not affect attractiveness of the area\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"reduce\",\n        \"text\": \"Reduce attractiveness of the area\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"dont_know\",\n        \"text\": \"I do not know\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"matrix\",\n      \"name\": \"statements\",\n      \"title\": \"How do you think about the following statements? Please answer according to your own views.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rows\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"s1\",\n        \"text\": \"Wooden facade renovation and additional floor construction could be carried out in my residential area.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"s2\",\n        \"text\": \"Facade renovation and additional floor construction should be applied with wood rather than other materials.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"s3\",\n        \"text\": \"Facade renovation and additional floor construction materials don't matter as long as the buildings look nice.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"s4\",\n        \"text\": \"Suburban apartments that have reached the renovation age can be renovated with wooden facades and additional floors.\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"columns\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"completely_agree\",\n        \"text\": \"completely agree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"partially_agree\",\n        \"text\": \"partially agree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"neutral\",\n        \"text\": \"neutral\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"partially_disagree\",\n        \"text\": \"partially disagree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"completely_disagree\",\n        \"text\": \"completely disagree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"dont_know\",\n        \"text\": \"I do not know\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"pictures\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\"